{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://adcontextprotocol.org/schemas/3.2.0-beta.5/mcp/2026-07-28/profiles/media-buy/account/list-accounts-response.json",
  "type": "object",
  "allOf": [
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1version-envelope.json"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1protocol-envelope.json"
    }
  ],
  "properties": {
    "accounts": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1account-with-authorization.json"
      }
    },
    "errors": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1error.json"
      }
    },
    "pagination": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1pagination-response.json"
    },
    "context": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1context.json"
    },
    "ext": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1ext.json"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "accounts"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "$defs": {
    "external:core/version-envelope.json": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "adcp_version": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(?:0|[1-9]\\d*)(?:-[a-zA-Z0-9](?:[a-zA-Z0-9.-]*[a-zA-Z0-9])?)?$"
        },
        "adcp_major_version": {
          "type": "integer",
          "deprecated": true,
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 99
        }
      }
    },
    "external:core/protocol-envelope.json": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "context_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "context": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1context.json"
        },
        "task_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "x-entity": "task"
        },
        "status": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1task-status.json"
        },
        "message": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "timestamp": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "replayed": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false
        },
        "adcp_error": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1error.json"
        },
        "push_notification_config": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1push-notification-config.json"
        },
        "governance_context": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 4096,
          "pattern": "^[\\x20-\\x7E]+$"
        },
        "payload": {
          "type": "object",
          "x-adcp-open-payload": true,
          "additionalProperties": true
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "status"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "not": {
        "anyOf": [
          {
            "required": [
              "task_status"
            ]
          },
          {
            "required": [
              "response_status"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "notes": [
        "Task response schemas (e.g., get-products-response.json) define ONLY the body fields; protocol-layer fields live on this envelope.",
        "Transport serialization (normative):",
        "  - MCP: envelope fields and task-body fields are siblings at the root of the tool response. The `payload` object is NOT serialized as a nested key — its body fields are flattened to the root alongside `status`, `context_id`, `context`, etc. This matches MCP's native `structuredContent` convention and is what shipping SDKs (@adcp/client) emit. Conformant MCP receivers parse from the flat root; receivers that expect a nested `payload` key MUST migrate.",
        "  - A2A 1.0 with the AdCP profile extension: `task.status.state` carries the transport invocation lifecycle used to select the extraction location; `task.contextId` carries `context_id`, while `task.id` is an independent A2A transport identifier. The complete AdCP response, including its protocol-level `status` and any application-layer `task_id`, is canonically carried in `task.artifacts[0].parts[].DataPart` on final states; `task.status.message.parts[].DataPart` is the fallback container used only for interim A2A states (working, native submitted, input-required) where no final artifact has been emitted yet. For a structured AdCP business rejection or Submitted response, A2A is `completed` while the DataPart carries `status: rejected` or `status: submitted` because the handler invocation succeeded. An AdCP `task_id` MUST NOT be copied into artifact metadata or inferred from `task.id`. Receivers MUST prefer artifacts when present and MUST NOT overwrite a DataPart's status with the A2A state. See `a2a-profile-extension.mdx` and `a2a-response-extraction.mdx` for the full binding and extraction algorithm.",
        "  - REST: envelope fields MAY ride on HTTP headers (e.g., `X-AdCP-Status`, `X-AdCP-Context-Id`) or as JSON body siblings; body fields appear at the JSON body root. Implementers choosing the header path SHOULD also mirror to body siblings for non-streaming callers.",
        "Across all three: envelope and body fields are conceptually a single response object. A task response schema MAY declare body fields with the same name as envelope fields (e.g., `errors[]` body-level for per-record validation results vs envelope-level for fatal task failure) and the two MUST be treated as distinct fields by name within their respective namespaces — see `error-handling.mdx#envelope-vs-payload-errors-the-two-layer-model`.",
        "`status` is REQUIRED on the conceptual AdCP response across all transports. On MCP and REST it appears as a sibling field at the JSON root (or `structuredContent` root for MCP). On A2A it is carried inside the authoritative DataPart alongside the task body; `task.status.state` separately carries the A2A transport lifecycle and selects where that DataPart is found. Receivers MUST preserve the DataPart status when present. The schema-level `required: [status]` enforces the post-extraction AdCP shape. `payload` remains intentionally NOT required — it is a documentary grouping construct, never a required wire field. See `mcp-guide.mdx` and `a2a-guide.mdx` for the wire-level patterns receivers MUST implement.",
        "Receivers MUST handle absence of an envelope field (e.g., `replayed` omitted) as the field's documented default — see each field's `default` clause."
      ]
    },
    "external:core/context.json": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true
    },
    "external:enums/task-status.json": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "submitted",
        "working",
        "input-required",
        "completed",
        "canceled",
        "failed",
        "rejected",
        "auth-required",
        "unknown"
      ]
    },
    "external:core/error.json": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "code": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 64
        },
        "message": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "field": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "suggestion": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "retry_after": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 3600
        },
        "issues": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "pointer": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "keyword": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "schemaPath": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "schema_id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "discriminator": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "property_name": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "value": {
                      "type": [
                        "string",
                        "number",
                        "boolean",
                        "null"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "property_name",
                    "value"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "pointer",
              "message",
              "keyword"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": true
          }
        },
        "details": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true
        },
        "recovery": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "transient",
            "correctable",
            "terminal"
          ]
        },
        "source": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "producer",
            "sdk"
          ]
        },
        "sdk_id": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "code",
        "message"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true
    },
    "external:core/push-notification-config.json": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "url": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "uri"
        },
        "operation_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 255,
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]{1,255}$"
        },
        "token": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 16,
          "maxLength": 4096
        },
        "authentication": {
          "type": "object",
          "deprecated": true,
          "properties": {
            "schemes": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1auth-scheme.json"
              },
              "minItems": 1,
              "maxItems": 1
            },
            "credentials": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 32
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "schemes",
            "credentials"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "url"
      ]
    },
    "external:enums/auth-scheme.json": {
      "deprecated": true,
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "Bearer",
        "HMAC-SHA256"
      ]
    },
    "external:core/account-with-authorization.json": {
      "allOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1account.json"
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "authorization": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1account-authorization.json"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "external:core/account.json": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "account_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "x-entity": "account"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "advertiser": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "billing_proxy": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "status": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1account-status.json"
        },
        "brand": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1brand-ref.json"
        },
        "operator": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[a-z0-9]([a-z0-9-]*[a-z0-9])?(\\.[a-z0-9]([a-z0-9-]*[a-z0-9])?)*$",
          "x-entity": "operator"
        },
        "operator_unit": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1operator-unit.json"
        },
        "revision": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "identity_change": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1account-identity-change.json"
        },
        "currency": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z]{3}$"
        },
        "timezone": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "billing": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1billing-party.json"
        },
        "billing_entity": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1business-entity.json"
        },
        "destination_billing_entity": {
          "not": {}
        },
        "rate_card": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "payment_terms": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1payment-terms.json"
        },
        "credit_limit": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "amount": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0
            },
            "currency": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Z]{3}$"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "amount",
            "currency"
          ]
        },
        "setup": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "url": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri"
            },
            "message": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "expires_at": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "message"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": true
        },
        "account_scope": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1account-scope.json"
        },
        "governance_agents": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "url": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uri",
                "pattern": "^https://"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "url"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 1
        },
        "reporting_bucket": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "protocol": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1cloud-storage-protocol.json"
            },
            "bucket": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 3,
              "maxLength": 63,
              "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9.-]{1,61}[a-z0-9]$"
            },
            "prefix": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 512,
              "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9/_.-]+$"
            },
            "region": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 64,
              "pattern": "^[a-z0-9-]+$"
            },
            "format": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "jsonl",
                "csv",
                "parquet",
                "avro",
                "orc"
              ],
              "default": "jsonl"
            },
            "compression": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "gzip",
                "none"
              ],
              "default": "gzip"
            },
            "file_retention_days": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "setup_instructions": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri",
              "pattern": "^https://"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "protocol",
            "bucket",
            "file_retention_days"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "sandbox": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "notification_configs": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1notification-config.json"
          },
          "maxItems": 16
        },
        "webhook_activity": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1webhook-activity-record.json"
          },
          "maxItems": 200
        },
        "ext": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1ext.json"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "account_id",
        "name",
        "status"
      ],
      "not": {
        "required": [
          "destination_billing_entity"
        ]
      },
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "dependentRequired": {
        "identity_change": [
          "revision"
        ]
      }
    },
    "external:enums/account-status.json": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "active",
        "pending_approval",
        "rejected",
        "payment_required",
        "suspended",
        "closed"
      ]
    },
    "external:core/brand-ref.json": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "domain": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[a-z0-9]([a-z0-9-]*[a-z0-9])?(\\.[a-z0-9]([a-z0-9-]*[a-z0-9])?)*$"
        },
        "brand_id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1brand-id.json"
        },
        "countries": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[A-Z]{2}$"
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "uniqueItems": true
        },
        "industries": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "data_subject_contestation": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "url": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri",
              "pattern": "^https://"
            },
            "email": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "email"
            },
            "languages": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "required": [
                "url"
              ]
            },
            {
              "required": [
                "email"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "brand_kit_override": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "logo": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1assets~1image-asset.json"
            },
            "colors": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "primary": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                },
                "secondary": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                },
                "accent": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}$"
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": true
            },
            "voice": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "tagline": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": true
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "domain"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "external:core/brand-id.json": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_]+$",
      "x-entity": "advertiser_brand"
    },
    "external:core/assets/image-asset.json": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "asset_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "const": "image"
        },
        "url": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "uri"
        },
        "width": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "height": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "file_size_bytes": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "pixel_ratio": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "format": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "alt_text": {
          "type": "string",
          "x-accessibility": true
        },
        "provenance": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1provenance.json"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "asset_type",
        "url",
        "width",
        "height"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true
    },
    "external:core/provenance.json": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "digital_source_type": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1digital-source-type.json"
        },
        "synthetic_depiction": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "ai_tool": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "version": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "provider": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "name"
          ]
        },
        "human_oversight": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "none",
            "prompt_only",
            "selected",
            "edited",
            "directed"
          ]
        },
        "declared_by": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "agent_url": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri"
            },
            "role": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "creator",
                "advertiser",
                "agency",
                "platform",
                "tool"
              ]
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "role"
          ]
        },
        "declared_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "created_time": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "c2pa": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "manifest_url": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "manifest_url"
          ]
        },
        "embedded_provenance": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "method": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1embedded-provenance-method.json"
              },
              "standard": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "provider": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "verify_agent": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "agent_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uri",
                    "pattern": "^https://"
                  },
                  "feature_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "agent_url"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              "embedded_at": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "method",
              "provider"
            ]
          }
        },
        "watermarks": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "media_type": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1watermark-media-type.json"
              },
              "provider": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "verify_agent": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "agent_url": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "uri",
                    "pattern": "^https://"
                  },
                  "feature_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "agent_url"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              },
              "c2pa_action": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1c2pa-watermark-action.json"
              },
              "embedded_at": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "media_type",
              "provider"
            ]
          }
        },
        "disclosure": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "required": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "jurisdictions": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "country": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "region": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "regulation": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "label_text": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "render_guidance": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "minProperties": 1,
                    "properties": {
                      "persistence": {
                        "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1disclosure-persistence.json"
                      },
                      "min_duration_ms": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": 1
                      },
                      "positions": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "$ref": "#/$defs/external:enums~1disclosure-position.json"
                        },
                        "minItems": 1,
                        "uniqueItems": true
                      },
                      "ext": {
                        "$ref": "#/$defs/external:core~1ext.json"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "country",
                  "regulation"
                ]
              },
              "minItems": 1
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "required"
          ]
        },
        "verification": {
          "type": "array",
